---
// src/components/FeeGuide.astro
---

<section id="fee-guide" class="py-14 bg-neutral-50/40 dark:bg-[#050505] border-t border-neutral-200/70 dark:border-neutral-800/80">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-200"></span>
        Reference Documentation
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#171717] dark:text-white">
        Indian Marketplace Fee Structures Explained (2026 Slabs)
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mt-2">
        Understand how Amazon, Flipkart, and Meesho calculate commissions, closing fees, courier weight slabs, and government deductions.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3-Column Marketplace Breakdown Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mb-10">
      
      <!-- Amazon India Card -->
      <div class="card-ver p-5 bg-white dark:bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-neutral-200/80 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-subtle flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="font-bold text-base text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">Amazon India</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/60 text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-900/50">Easy Ship &amp; FBA</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 mb-2">Closing Fee Slabs</h3>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 dark:border-neutral-800 overflow-hidden text-xs mb-4">
            <table class="w-full text-left">
              <tbody class="divide-y divide-neutral-100 dark:divide-neutral-800 font-mono">
                <tr class="bg-neutral-50/50 dark:bg-[#111111]/50">
                  <td class="p-2 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 font-sans">₹0 &ndash; ₹250</td>
                  <td class="p-2 font-bold text-right text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">₹5.00</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="p-2 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 font-sans">₹251 &ndash; ₹500</td>
                  <td class="p-2 font-bold text-right text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">₹10.00</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="bg-neutral-50/50 dark:bg-[#111111]/50">
                  <td class="p-2 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 font-sans">₹501 &ndash; ₹1,000</td>
                  <td class="p-2 font-bold text-right text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">₹25.00</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="p-2 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 font-sans">₹1,001 &ndash; ₹2,000</td>
                  <td class="p-2 font-bold text-right text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">₹35.00</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="bg-neutral-50/50 dark:bg-[#111111]/50">
                  <td class="p-2 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 font-sans">₹2,001+</td>
                  <td class="p-2 font-bold text-right text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">₹50.00</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            Amazon also charges category referral fees (5% to 15%) and weight handling fees starting at ₹44 (Local), ₹53 (Regional), and ₹74 (National) for the first 500g.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Flipkart Card -->
      <div class="card-ver p-5 bg-white dark:bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-neutral-200/80 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-subtle flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="font-bold text-base text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">Flipkart</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/60 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-300 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-900/50">Non-FBF &amp; FBF</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 mb-2">Fixed Fee Slabs</h3>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 dark:border-neutral-800 overflow-hidden text-xs mb-4">
            <table class="w-full text-left">
              <tbody class="divide-y divide-neutral-100 dark:divide-neutral-800 font-mono">
                <tr class="bg-neutral-50/50 dark:bg-[#111111]/50">
                  <td class="p-2 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 font-sans">₹0 &ndash; ₹300</td>
                  <td class="p-2 font-bold text-right text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">₹13.00</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="p-2 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 font-sans">₹301 &ndash; ₹500</td>
                  <td class="p-2 font-bold text-right text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">₹17.00</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="bg-neutral-50/50 dark:bg-[#111111]/50">
                  <td class="p-2 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 font-sans">₹501 &ndash; ₹1,000</td>
                  <td class="p-2 font-bold text-right text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">₹30.00</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="p-2 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 font-sans">₹1,001+</td>
                  <td class="p-2 font-bold text-right text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">₹52.00</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            Flipkart charges a 2% collection fee on order payments. Shipping fees depend on seller tier (Bronze, Silver, Gold) and distance (Local ₹44, Regional ₹54, National ₹69).
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Meesho Card -->
      <div class="card-ver p-5 bg-white dark:bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-neutral-200/80 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-subtle flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="font-bold text-base text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">Meesho</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-pink-50 dark:bg-pink-950/60 text-pink-800 dark:text-pink-300 border border-pink-200 dark:border-pink-900/50">Zero Commission</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 mb-2">Shipping Weight Slabs</h3>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 dark:border-neutral-800 overflow-hidden text-xs mb-4">
            <table class="w-full text-left">
              <tbody class="divide-y divide-neutral-100 dark:divide-neutral-800 font-mono">
                <tr class="bg-neutral-50/50 dark:bg-[#111111]/50">
                  <td class="p-2 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 font-sans">0 &ndash; 500g</td>
                  <td class="p-2 font-bold text-right text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">₹49.00</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="p-2 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 font-sans">501g &ndash; 1,000g</td>
                  <td class="p-2 font-bold text-right text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">₹85.00</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="bg-neutral-50/50 dark:bg-[#111111]/50">
                  <td class="p-2 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 font-sans">1,001g &ndash; 1,500g</td>
                  <td class="p-2 font-bold text-right text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">₹125.00</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="p-2 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 font-sans">Each addl 500g</td>
                  <td class="p-2 font-bold text-right text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">+ ₹40.00</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            Meesho has 0% commission and ₹0 fixed closing fees. However, sellers must budget for customer return reverse courier penalties (approx ₹120-150) and ruined packaging.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- GST & ITC Knowledge Box -->
    <div class="card-ver p-5 sm:p-7 bg-white dark:bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-neutral-200/80 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-subtle">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/60 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800/50">
            Important Tax Tip
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white mt-2">
            Claiming GST Input Tax Credit (ITC) on Marketplace Fees
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Did you know? The 18% GST deducted by Amazon, Flipkart, and Meesho on their commission, closing fees, and shipping is <strong>100% claimable as Input Tax Credit (ITC)</strong> on your monthly GSTR-3B filings!
          </p>
          <ul class="text-xs text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 space-y-2 mt-4">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">&check;</span> Download monthly Tax Invoices from Seller Central / Seller Hub.
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">&check;</span> Match GSTR-2B with the GST charged on seller commission.
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">&check;</span> Offset against output GST payable on customer sales.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-[#111111] border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 rounded-xl p-5 text-xs text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 space-y-3 font-mono">
          <div class="text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 font-sans uppercase font-semibold text-[11px]">Example Payout vs Tax Reconciliation</div>
          <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 pb-2">
            <span>Marketplace Fee Before Tax:</span>
            <span class="text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">₹100.00</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 pb-2 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400">
            <span>18% GST Deducted from Payout:</span>
            <span>- ₹18.00</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold">
            <span>ITC Cash Refund / Offset in GSTR-3B:</span>
            <span>+ ₹18.00</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
